.\" man page create by R# package system.
.TH BIOSEQ.PATTERNS 2 2000-1月 "open.seedFile" "open.seedFile"
.SH NAME
open.seedFile \- open the sequence seed scan data file
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIopen.seedFile(\fBfile\fR as any, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
open the sequence seed scan data file
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBfile\fB \fR\- 
 the file path of the seed scan data file, or a file stream object of 
 the target seed scan data file.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment object.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a [ScanFile](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.SequenceTools.SequencePatterns.Motif.ScanFile) sequence seed data file object for read or 
 save the seed data in a stream manner, which can be used by the 
 \fBpull.all_seeds\fR api or the \fBcreate.seeds\fR api;
 
 this function returns a R# error message object if the given file can 
 not be opened for read/write.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
bioseq.patterns
.SH FILES
.PP
seqtoolkit.dll
.PP
